      "sourceTextSha256": "3ca8cab4a8bbd748b88a10cd58f877520f7c97f68489184c17f068d4a537aeef",
      "previousTranslation": "“这个世界军方的战术，\n　是以和同等级技术交战为前提制定的。”",
      "finalTranslation": "“这个世界军方的战术，\n　都是建立在与同等科技水平对手\n　作战的基础之上。”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "e3f0523e-2b46-4185-93d3-e1ababf001c1",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/02.03/0017",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "34a20f5e3142bb0042f4e9809248f400eaac894b233b01119c3151344cba0e56",
      "previousTranslation": "“我知道你有干劲，但$n……”",
      "finalTranslation": "“你有这个心意是好的，$n酱…”",
      "choice": "nero"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "be900518-0d3e-4781-990d-0d800576cca5",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/02.03/0015",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4f77f88d2d4c1d79abe24d2ed26bfddd8264108c00ca680838724b5d5f9f1cc7",
      "previousTranslation": "“而且我开发的蓝色修复者机体巴尔迪·普莱兹\n　和阳光号，距离成熟还差得很远。”",
      "finalTranslation": "“而且我开发的蓝色修复者机体勇者突进号\n　和履带游侠号，距离成熟还差得很远。”",
      "choice": "custom"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "b68ff1af-00be-494b-9e8f-0d04d826340b",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/02.03/0035",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d26d4264fc7cba2baa7a59bdb1b2294cef3b63f06a484c76f63c450db85f74d6",
      "previousTranslation": "“不能放着城里的人，\n　也不能放着那台独自奋战的机器人不管！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“不能放着镇里的人，\n　也不能放着那台独自奋战的机器人不管！”",
      "choice": "recommended"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "4492ac65-039d-49b8-b721-eb73e59716c5",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/02.03/0037",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4ec112a2059ffbef3a48dbbf7daf60f5c1479ba7f50d26cefc4ee4544bcebdac",
      "previousTranslation": "“少尉，别露出那种表情。\n　当然，我们也要一起去。”",
      "finalTranslation": "“少尉，别露出那种表情。\n　我们当然也要一起去。”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "1345161c-cfe3-430d-b004-b40d31e0a58c",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/02.03/0039",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0ed190fc1cab9036849bcc14cd207ea0e1c210af8a7939c8a2f9da331c46d8fe",
      "previousTranslation": "“这次逃跑之后，\n　我们的处境肯定会更加危险……”",
      "finalTranslation": "“虽说这次逃跑之后，\n　我们的处境肯定会更加危险……”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "776bc62c-c186-4126-b079-d86e1517633d",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/02.03/0040",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7a2989e66689232facfe57aeb90f869a0c402f288e7fe1596f6fa2bcfcab5359",
      "previousTranslation": "“即便如此，\n　也有些事是我们非做不可的……对吧？”",
      "finalTranslation": "“不过就算这样，\n　也有些事是我们非做不可的……对吧？”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "f590b73b-d4bc-4e2a-9b94-8c837cbdebed",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/02.03/0042",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "13975aabd8c2a295197bafe5ef975cc56f3b603c5ed5cf9a5d0b146fe100c8de",
      "previousTranslation": "“笑得不错！……我还是第一次看到你笑吧？”",
      "finalTranslation": "“<width:0E><space:0C>Nice smile<width:16><space:16>！\n　我还是第一次看到你笑吧？”",
      "choice": "submitted"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "ce63c356-423e-487a-bcb2-9da552e4f201",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/02.03/0043",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "f0a96a7b9290cca5ce42a9bde1363b343ed2c38147024b884644e8b80b7f1a39",
      "previousTranslation": "“……或许吧。”",
      "finalTranslation": "“说不定真是这样呢。”",
      "choice": "submitted"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "9924197b-4dfa-4e7c-95f6-07ac48869380",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.20/0000",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e8b549c1c937ea14fc1002a038f922ed28854034796418ed3fe0235a980ddb2b",
      "previousTranslation": "“等一下！不管怎么说也太多了吧！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“等一下！不管怎么说这也太多了吧！”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "e7afedaf-b830-4e53-9da9-1835097543ad",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.20/0002",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "803070f717e9df8599152c5ce792b7bb74205f007de48e105e74ee3377fcd48f",
      "previousTranslation": "“亚纪、美知，快逃！\n　来这么多敌人，城镇会被彻底毁掉的！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“亚纪、美知，快逃！\n　来这么多敌人，城镇会被彻底毁掉的！”",
      "choice": "recommended"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "d817f95d-35fe-4469-86f6-7b865778482c",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.20/0003",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e8f4ea40414038dafcd84a7e3a817a1b420c322b468741d261693aab8b90509b",
      "previousTranslation": "“好、好！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“嗯、嗯！”",
      "choice": "recommended"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "ecedd4a6-aadc-451d-9f97-999c09a6ff89",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.21/0000",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7c445bca983c0d51afa7a9ad261007ca06e569c008f7ae5deaa73f253bc7aae7",
      "previousTranslation": "“可、可恶啊啊啊啊！他们从四面八方开火！\n　这样下去我会被干掉的！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“可恶啊！不管跑到哪里都在挨打！\n　这样下去迟早会被干掉！”",
      "choice": "nero"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "9c2fc104-e1ea-4d12-91f6-9cd2660f0d1d",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.23/0011",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "85940383a8986966f989ba9f0eaf901f612c30376619534f2385b53582c3343e",
      "previousTranslation": "“连狗也坐在里面！？”",
      "finalTranslation": "“狗也会驾驶么！？”",
      "choice": "submitted"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "befb0ce3-500a-4ac1-a758-2836fea64b03",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.23/0012",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "1d83d67bc436b46374b550d4be7008e9f5dc605ff4babdaa2fffd3d18fcf3c3d",
      "previousTranslation": "“杜克·弗里德，寒暄之后再说！既然确认他\n　是地球人，接下来只要收拾外星人就行了！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“杜克·弗里德，晚点再打招呼！既然确认他\n　是地球人，接下来只要收拾外星人就行了！”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "09f6b9c0-d8d8-47d8-b2dc-019c66faa587",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.36/0003",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e43248ca34a51e555d41c0acc5704cada9a9f153835fa9865909826e9d248754",
      "previousTranslation": "“对、对不起！是我说了多余的话！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“对、对不起！我发言越界了！”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "72a946f7-5220-4592-8631-de0a0fb203f0",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.24/0000",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "cebb1220a78a4a27a1a07977687e250db1c834776d62ba093355f818191446cc",
      "previousTranslation": "“嘿嘿！下次再来送死吧！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“嘿嘿！对付我你们还不够格！”",
      "choice": "nero"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "5b93c1f3-fad3-4484-8897-34ec4f12c7ec",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.24/0001",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "5143687a04142b8fa28b9019d88975fecee6f50c534af7aeead59d58b3b988a9",
      "previousTranslation": "“真是个现实的家伙。想到接下来要发生的事，\n　我们可是心情沉重啊……”",
      "finalTranslation": "“真是个只顾眼前的家伙。\n　可一想到接下来的麻烦，\n　我们可是很郁闷啊……”",
      "choice": "submitted"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "f81ce2d2-7f0c-4d6c-b558-6f6145bb5f09",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.25/0000",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "43e7e8a6461c97374bc2b244ca09064ffc37c5a851252be5a795293cd77373af",
      "previousTranslation": "“看来军队已经赶到了。”",
      "finalTranslation": "“看来军方已经赶到了。”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "445e36c4-36bb-4ab8-b00d-3d494a884b94",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.26/0000",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "9232e9276a5c3ee2e153fad8132084e60693a805c93f3b986783e765d9e52cf1",
      "previousTranslation": "“我们要拘捕你们这些逃兵！\n　解除武装，离开机体！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“我们要拘捕你们这些逃走的！\n　解除武装，离开机体！”",
      "choice": "custom"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "16406c1d-ff21-4938-b865-b0cdc07e7989",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.26/0001",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "a999ff0a91f151ef4f6f1476d0d5b606f6cd772ec8569dd165288182e76e8eaa",
      "previousTranslation": "“等一下！逃兵是怎么回事！？”",
      "finalTranslation": "“等一下！说我们逃走是怎么回事！？”",
      "choice": "custom"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "5ddfae70-3428-4551-835e-c79517fecd2b",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.27/0000",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "480860ebd84302b5d195879ee1bfcb736a8bfa014bef53a80000708aa6e59d47",
      "previousTranslation": "“他们开枪了……！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“他们开火了！”",
      "choice": "submitted"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "df52bf55-e02d-46ec-bc30-5f6186f408f4",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.27/0002",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0adc6e54bbae9875eeb9be935287d26f9eb8309baf6bf85abafdb8974e4a27c4",
      "previousTranslation": "“当然，你们这些身份不明的机体也一样。”",
      "finalTranslation": "“当然，对面那台身份不明的机体也一样。”",
      "choice": "submitted"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "81f488d0-69d5-445b-9a84-ea4dc25c3a1e",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.27/0008",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "cf7ed8a61d4fd37a0c82b4399741f17a29940a0804a8ff0ffd63a21e99c8df19",
      "previousTranslation": "“事情办完后，就编造我们逃跑的罪名，\n　打算彻底把我们控制起来吗？”",
      "finalTranslation": "“然后等事情处理完了就说我们是逃走的，\n　将我们统统拘禁起来是吧”",
      "choice": "nero"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "8103f4ba-3c53-4517-8da9-0b229b3570c0",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.27/0009",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "6bb7fb7f9cf5712fafb31263b019c620c50474a0ee43307e3ef5cae5870b0f3d",
      "previousTranslation": "“可恶！我们被当成好用的免费劳工了……”",
      "finalTranslation": "“切！合着我们被当成好用的免费武力了……”",
      "choice": "submitted"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "8262944c-bdd1-46df-9157-1195754bec31",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.27/0011",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e1804c729bb8c4efe3dd1058670e202f7dc660ab7fa6d35591fddd0a33985e13",
      "previousTranslation": "“不行，胜平！要是攻击他们，\n　我们真的会变成坏人！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“不行，小朋友！如果攻击他们的话，\n　我们真的会被当成坏人的！”",
      "choice": "nero"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "9de0d996-87a5-4f33-a7e4-047622e121f3",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.28/0000",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "b8229166ea2da98f945310b07809e2cf7001cbdbc4c6c3f7ed8f94d0d6d8f662",
      "previousTranslation": "“那艘船是什么！？”",
      "finalTranslation": "“那艘母舰是怎么回事！？”",
      "choice": "nero"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "e4aa4590-88a1-4ddc-b1a2-4e2542a2a049",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.28/0004",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "6f9658b239716aa6935ce91a5a0cfe29f402a7332b8d8ba2e2d8f6f6d696eca1",
      "previousTranslation": "“荣耀之星各机注意！\n　机动战士部队已经阵脚大乱！趁现在撤离！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“荣耀之星各机注意！\n　趁对面机动战士部队阵脚大乱，赶紧撤离！”",
      "choice": "custom"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "eca9a2fe-1add-4207-9a19-4ae74a2abd82",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.28/0005",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7ae8aff0c35d8f1bb52fe4e9b906b96f9fd303a29e566c6afade3c3cca21e8b0",
      "previousTranslation": "“明白！虽然对不起长官他们，\n　被抓住恐怕会很麻烦！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“明白！虽然对不起长官他们，\n　但要是被抓住麻烦会更大！”",
      "choice": "submitted"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "d5473fa7-e8d9-4e67-8362-ab0c0cc9f344",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.29/0001",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "20b2e52969f41e52dcdeb5d182b9d5331187fc4c6a19a3f9890b91307ac38ef6",
      "previousTranslation": "“少来！\n　擅自把我们当成逃兵的不就是你们吗！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“少来！\n　擅自认定我们在逃跑的不是你们吗！”",
      "choice": "custom"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "329c654c-8c6f-4232-b28f-ebaf922f2b38",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.29/0002",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "f63f0babf4c27ab3c8732aecb2b22ecd91e3d9af894d3c8ec5bc0b97a27613d5",
      "previousTranslation": "“那就再见了，军人大叔！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“那就再见啦，军人大叔！”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "92692225-f5f8-4a00-8c22-4b5e983b46d9",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.28/0007",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "8f1526ea1d37a7e01a08c404c352dd2fdd3ebd9c19383b85486c6d1a90f2e8ed",
      "previousTranslation": "“……好。现在看来，这是最好的办法。”",
      "finalTranslation": "“……明白了。当下来看这是上策。”",
      "choice": "submitted"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "95d94c0a-a9be-4e1e-81ee-a4e6c19eb831",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.30/0000",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "2bb5eeb33ccb3c81629436460d03eee4b7bf66b887b637e507414e86dee3d7aa",
      "previousTranslation": "“不、不行！向总部报告，派搜索队过来！\n　无论如何都要抓住他们！！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“糟了！赶快向总部报告，派搜索队过来！\n　无论如何都要抓住他们！！”",
      "choice": "submitted"
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "3dce0fff-e633-441f-8968-e49c1ba1f4ce",
      "targetId": "story/006/dialogue/01.30/0002",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "9e0351dab7aa14ba7b5e5c5025f7153b0e11e7bf7dd34015308a31e3ad2c6344",
      "previousTranslation": "“我是一时忍不住出手帮了他们，\n　接下来……他们会怎么行动呢……”",
      "finalTranslation": "“虽说一时忍不住出手帮了他们，\n　那接下来……他们会怎么行动呢？”",
      "choice": "submitted"
    }
  ],
